The text below is about the account payable process. It starts with filing a copy for internal records. 
Once filing a copy for internal records occurs, creating a receiving report needs to be done. 
After creating a receiving report, one or more of the following paths should be executed: reporting errors to relevant team member, gathering the vendors invoice, doubling check a three-way match. 
